1
00:01:29,864 --> 00:01:34,536
[Adapted from Che Ye Liu Xiang's
novel of the same name]

2
00:02:02,976 --> 00:02:05,075
[Episode 2]

3
00:02:05,831 --> 00:02:08,164
The stock market is just as hot today.

4
00:02:08,164 --> 00:02:11,945
The index jumped 232.26 points,

5
00:02:11,945 --> 00:02:16,183
finishing at 9,743.51.

6
00:02:16,183 --> 00:02:17,222
Hey, Lv Qing.

7
00:02:17,222 --> 00:02:18,931
You've spent time in Gangcheng.

8
00:02:18,931 --> 00:02:21,097
What do you think
the people there are really after?

9
00:02:21,097 --> 00:02:23,056
I'd say they're just testing the waters.

10
00:02:23,056 --> 00:02:24,431
Haven't heard the old man mention it.

11
00:02:24,431 --> 00:02:26,347
Gangcheng people are very sharp.

12
00:02:26,347 --> 00:02:29,097
Gangcheng's finance aligns with the globe.

13
00:02:29,097 --> 00:02:30,972
It even runs in parallel.

14
00:02:30,972 --> 00:02:33,264
They must have information we're not privy to.

15
00:02:33,264 --> 00:02:34,931
Bucked the trend right out of the gate.

16
00:02:34,931 --> 00:02:36,847
Pulled in a flood of hot money.

17
00:02:36,847 --> 00:02:40,097
Zhuo Xin, you'd better go home

18
00:02:40,097 --> 00:02:41,472
and pump the old man for news.

19
00:02:41,472 --> 00:02:43,097
Uncle Zhuo can't be in the dark.

20
00:02:43,097 --> 00:02:46,224
Bro, I've finished the...

21
00:02:46,224 --> 00:02:48,139
Oh wow! Lv Qing!

22
00:02:48,139 --> 00:02:50,014
Someone new in the family, huh?

23
00:02:50,014 --> 00:02:52,023
Never seen this one before.

24
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,014
Xiao Fan.

25
00:02:57,014 --> 00:02:58,545
Come sit down.

26
00:03:14,097 --> 00:03:15,764
Hi there. I'm Lin Zi Yang.

27
00:03:15,764 --> 00:03:18,139
Pleased to meet you.

28
00:03:18,139 --> 00:03:20,567
Hello.

29
00:03:21,681 --> 00:03:25,306
Lv Qing, you guys are all so humorous!

30
00:03:25,306 --> 00:03:26,306
Zi Yang.

31
00:03:26,306 --> 00:03:27,806
You're a real jack of all trades.

32
00:03:27,806 --> 00:03:29,389
You fit right in anywhere.

33
00:03:29,389 --> 00:03:31,389
Hey. Now that's unfair.

34
00:03:31,389 --> 00:03:33,181
I've got good taste.

35
00:03:33,181 --> 00:03:35,847
We're talking about Senior Brother Bei's folks.

36
00:03:35,847 --> 00:03:39,389
Every one of them's worth getting close to.

37
00:03:39,389 --> 00:03:41,056
Xiao Fan.

38
00:03:41,056 --> 00:03:42,222
Got a question for you.

39
00:03:42,222 --> 00:03:44,556
So, what's your take on Gangcheng

40
00:03:44,556 --> 00:03:48,072
investing heavily in the mainland soon?

41
00:03:52,347 --> 00:03:55,562
I... I...

42
00:03:59,806 --> 00:04:02,064
I-I think

43
00:04:04,472 --> 00:04:09,264
our country is in a tough spot.

44
00:04:09,264 --> 00:04:13,575
Foreign funds may not help.

45
00:04:17,347 --> 00:04:18,639
Well then, Xiao Fan...

46
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:20,222
Xiao Fan.

47
00:04:20,222 --> 00:04:22,171
Have you finished your practice test?

48
00:04:23,264 --> 00:04:24,445
Yeah.

49
00:04:25,139 --> 00:04:26,431
Leave your test here.

50
00:04:26,431 --> 00:04:28,549
Go study English.

51
00:04:47,639 --> 00:04:50,264
<i>To keep up with the minds of these princelings,</i>

52
00:04:50,264 --> 00:04:53,097
<i>Lu Xiao Fan bought newspapers
and read them thoroughly.</i>

53
00:04:53,097 --> 00:04:55,472
<i>He jotted down what he wanted to say.</i>

54
00:04:55,472 --> 00:04:58,181
<i>But the first word he memorized</i>

55
00:04:58,181 --> 00:05:00,048
<i>was "brother".</i>

56
00:05:40,681 --> 00:05:42,580
Go buy some liquor with me.

57
00:06:17,931 --> 00:06:20,409
What have you been up to out there lately?

58
00:06:21,431 --> 00:06:23,181
Aunt Lin had me take soup over.

59
00:06:23,181 --> 00:06:24,181
He's been busy lately.

60
00:06:24,181 --> 00:06:26,139
Hardly gets to go home.

61
00:06:30,139 --> 00:06:31,722
Lapdog.

62
00:06:31,722 --> 00:06:34,070
Real pro at sucking up, aren't you?

63
00:06:35,222 --> 00:06:36,222
Lv Qing.

64
00:06:36,222 --> 00:06:40,347
Is Lu Xiao Fan your brother-in-law or wife?

65
00:06:40,347 --> 00:06:43,907
Soup, porridge, and he does the washing, too.

66
00:06:44,806 --> 00:06:46,223
He's a country boy.

67
00:06:46,223 --> 00:06:48,765
He just doesn't fit in here.

68
00:06:48,765 --> 00:06:51,240
If he wants to do it, let him go ahead.

69
00:06:52,847 --> 00:06:54,556
Listen up, Lv Qing.

70
00:06:54,556 --> 00:06:55,764
If this keeps up,

71
00:06:55,764 --> 00:06:58,056
it'll ruin your reputation

72
00:06:58,056 --> 00:07:00,306
as the big man on campus.

73
00:07:00,306 --> 00:07:02,056
I can put up with the rest.

74
00:07:02,056 --> 00:07:03,889
Every time he speaks at the salon,

75
00:07:03,889 --> 00:07:07,472
I bite my tongue till I nearly bleed!

76
00:07:07,472 --> 00:07:11,597
"I think our country is in a tough spot."

77
00:07:11,597 --> 00:07:14,597
Politics gets brought up
at least ten times a night.

78
00:07:14,597 --> 00:07:16,389
I think so, too. It's really serious.

79
00:07:16,389 --> 00:07:18,847
It really is very serious.

80
00:07:18,847 --> 00:07:20,097
All right, all right.

81
00:07:20,097 --> 00:07:21,140
Is it really necessary?

82
00:07:21,140 --> 00:07:24,806
So what? Are you saying folks
from the countryside

83
00:07:24,806 --> 00:07:27,614
aren't allowed to have
an opinion on world affairs?

84
00:07:28,764 --> 00:07:29,764
Still, Lv Qing.

85
00:07:29,764 --> 00:07:33,181
The trade director's son from the zone

86
00:07:33,181 --> 00:07:35,139
wants to join our salon, too.

87
00:07:35,139 --> 00:07:37,139
He went to Zhuo Xin on his own,

88
00:07:37,139 --> 00:07:39,472
bringing gifts and treating him to dinner.

89
00:07:39,472 --> 00:07:41,764
And Zhuo Xin turned him down flat.

90
00:07:41,764 --> 00:07:43,639
He was worried that type of person

91
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:45,556
would drag our salon down.

92
00:07:45,556 --> 00:07:47,764
If your brother-in-law
cracks jokes at our salon again.

93
00:07:47,764 --> 00:07:48,889
Word will get around.

94
00:07:48,889 --> 00:07:50,514
Here we are puffing ourselves up,

95
00:07:50,514 --> 00:07:52,472
acting like we're so refined.

96
00:07:52,472 --> 00:07:56,181
But people will think we're just a comedy club.

97
00:07:56,181 --> 00:07:58,597
Lu Xiao Fan just brings shame on us.

98
00:07:58,597 --> 00:08:00,056
- Just looking at him annoys me.
- Seriously.

99
00:08:00,056 --> 00:08:01,806
Is it really that big a deal?

100
00:08:01,806 --> 00:08:03,056
I'm just enjoying the novelty.

101
00:08:03,056 --> 00:08:04,931
It won't last long.

102
00:08:04,931 --> 00:08:06,056
You know he's not on our level,

103
00:08:06,056 --> 00:08:07,972
and yet you still pick on him.

104
00:08:07,972 --> 00:08:09,806
When a duck wanders into a flock of swans,

105
00:08:09,806 --> 00:08:12,222
nobody actually thinks you're ducks.

106
00:08:12,222 --> 00:08:14,764
Unless you were just
big white ducks to begin with.

107
00:08:14,764 --> 00:08:17,925
Fine, so long as you know.

108
00:08:23,889 --> 00:08:24,931
I'll leave you to it.

109
00:08:24,931 --> 00:08:26,997
Hey, Lv Qing.

110
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:31,972
<i>I'm just enjoying the novelty.</i>

111
00:08:31,972 --> 00:08:33,999
<i>The novelty will wear off soon enough.</i>

112
00:08:40,681 --> 00:08:41,972
<i>As the saying goes,</i>

113
00:08:41,972 --> 00:08:44,597
<i>birds of a feather flock together.</i>

114
00:08:44,597 --> 00:08:47,514
<i>But Xiao Fan still held a glimmer of hope.</i>

115
00:08:47,514 --> 00:08:49,597
<i>Xiao Fan knew they were worlds apart,</i>

116
00:08:49,597 --> 00:08:53,489
<i>like clouds and mud.</i>

117
00:08:59,722 --> 00:09:01,472
Good work lately.
[A Modern English-Chinese Dictionary]

118
00:09:01,472 --> 00:09:03,191
Keep it up.

119
00:09:04,699 --> 00:09:06,036
Okay.

120
00:09:09,021 --> 00:09:12,840
[Guangdong Traditional Soup Recipes]

121
00:09:15,472 --> 00:09:17,505
I don't like scallions.

122
00:09:21,056 --> 00:09:22,514
Big Bro.

123
00:09:22,514 --> 00:09:25,306
Y-You drank the soup.

124
00:09:25,306 --> 00:09:27,264
Stay away from such books.

125
00:09:27,264 --> 00:09:29,472
Focus on your studies.

126
00:09:29,472 --> 00:09:31,232
Got it, Big Bro.

127
00:09:35,556 --> 00:09:37,882
Join me at the salon from now on.

128
00:09:39,722 --> 00:09:41,347
Maybe not.

129
00:09:41,347 --> 00:09:43,181
I...

130
00:09:43,181 --> 00:09:45,617
I'm afraid I'll embarrass you.

131
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:50,514
Just sit next to me.

132
00:09:50,514 --> 00:09:53,046
Listen more, speak less.

133
00:10:14,014 --> 00:10:15,431
Acting like a real student.

134
00:10:15,431 --> 00:10:17,242
Such a clueless look on his face.

135
00:10:24,597 --> 00:10:27,681
Right here. You need to use "that"
to form an object clause,

136
00:10:27,681 --> 00:10:30,950
and it's also the subject of the clause.

137
00:10:37,181 --> 00:10:38,898
What did I just say?

138
00:10:40,597 --> 00:10:41,931
I need...

139
00:10:41,931 --> 00:10:44,539
I need to use a clause.

140
00:10:48,681 --> 00:10:50,078
And then?

141
00:10:51,806 --> 00:10:53,681
And then...

142
00:10:53,681 --> 00:10:55,556
And then...

143
00:10:55,556 --> 00:10:57,597
Let's stop here for today.

144
00:10:57,597 --> 00:10:59,264
Big Bro.

145
00:10:59,264 --> 00:11:01,476
Wait here just a moment.

146
00:11:03,347 --> 00:11:05,074
Wait for me.

147
00:11:22,264 --> 00:11:24,501
Just in time.

148
00:11:25,306 --> 00:11:27,966
Big Bro, give it a try.

149
00:11:33,389 --> 00:11:38,264
Thanks for tutoring me.

150
00:11:38,264 --> 00:11:43,222
Aunt Lin told me that you like stewed soup.

151
00:11:43,222 --> 00:11:46,027
So, I just...

152
00:11:47,472 --> 00:11:50,585
I've been tutoring you...

153
00:11:54,847 --> 00:11:57,448
so outsiders won't know

154
00:11:58,472 --> 00:12:01,400
a son-in-law of the Beis have no schooling.

155
00:12:07,806 --> 00:12:10,968
All right. Go get some rest.

156
00:13:04,347 --> 00:13:05,847
As we all know,

157
00:13:05,847 --> 00:13:07,931
Xiao Fan's international perspective

158
00:13:07,931 --> 00:13:10,514
has always been remarkably insightful.

159
00:13:10,514 --> 00:13:14,431
Why not let Xiao Fan start us off today?

160
00:13:14,431 --> 00:13:15,431
What do you say?

161
00:13:15,431 --> 00:13:18,347
Enough. Give it a rest.

162
00:13:18,347 --> 00:13:20,639
Aunt Lin. Pour us some water.

163
00:13:20,639 --> 00:13:22,416
I'll do it.

164
00:13:34,056 --> 00:13:36,931
Aunt Lin, get me a roast duck, too.

165
00:13:36,931 --> 00:13:38,599
I'll go.

166
00:13:42,097 --> 00:13:45,264
Mom, I'm doing really well in Yunjing.

167
00:13:45,264 --> 00:13:46,764
Mr. Bei treats me very well.

168
00:13:46,764 --> 00:13:49,014
Big Bro Bei treats me well, too.

169
00:13:49,014 --> 00:13:50,556
So, don't worry about me.

170
00:13:50,556 --> 00:13:53,431
Go home early with Dad.

171
00:13:53,431 --> 00:13:54,639
<i>Xiao Fan.</i>

172
00:13:54,639 --> 00:13:57,972
<i>Could you ask Mr. Bei
to write a recommendation letter?</i>

173
00:13:57,972 --> 00:13:59,806
<i>Ping Ping is about to graduate soon.</i>

174
00:13:59,806 --> 00:14:02,347
<i>Job assignments need to be lined up in advance.</i>

175
00:14:02,347 --> 00:14:05,556
<i>Ask Mr. Bei for advice.</i>

176
00:14:05,556 --> 00:14:11,431
Mom, my schooling has troubled the Beis enough.

177
00:14:11,431 --> 00:14:13,097
<i>We're useless.</i>

178
00:14:13,097 --> 00:14:16,556
<i>We can take care of one son but not the other.</i>

179
00:14:16,556 --> 00:14:18,556
<i>I hate to be a bother to you.</i>

180
00:14:18,556 --> 00:14:20,764
<i>Is this hard for you, Fan Fan?</i>

181
00:14:20,764 --> 00:14:22,556
No, not at all, Mom.

182
00:14:22,556 --> 00:14:24,588
Don't overthink it.

183
00:14:25,639 --> 00:14:26,855
I...

184
00:14:27,806 --> 00:14:29,961
I'll go ask Mr. Bei.

185
00:14:30,639 --> 00:14:32,222
<i>I'll come by the shop in a few days</i>

186
00:14:32,222 --> 00:14:33,472
<i>and give you a call.</i>

187
00:14:33,472 --> 00:14:35,985
<i>Take care of yourself, Xiao Fan.</i>

188
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,845
Okay.

189
00:14:41,014 --> 00:14:42,014
<i>You've risen to the sky in one leap.</i>

190
00:14:42,014 --> 00:14:44,931
<i>How are you still acting like such a bumpkin?</i>

191
00:15:00,681 --> 00:15:02,427
The soup's about to boil over.

192
00:15:05,806 --> 00:15:06,807
Big Bro.

193
00:15:06,807 --> 00:15:08,722
The soup will be ready soon.

194
00:15:08,722 --> 00:15:10,933
I'll bring it over at dinnertime.

195
00:15:11,889 --> 00:15:13,431
About your brother,

196
00:15:13,431 --> 00:15:15,427
I'll talk to Dad.

197
00:15:16,806 --> 00:15:19,060
How did you know?

198
00:15:21,181 --> 00:15:24,104
The two floors share the same phone line.

199
00:15:24,722 --> 00:15:28,347
I've learned many new soup recipes.

200
00:15:28,347 --> 00:15:30,444
I can cook soup for you every day.

201
00:15:31,347 --> 00:15:33,431
I won't be home for dinner this week.

202
00:15:34,556 --> 00:15:36,056
The salon has moved to campus.

203
00:15:36,056 --> 00:15:38,389
I can't make it home in the evening.

204
00:15:38,389 --> 00:15:39,389
I see.

205
00:15:39,389 --> 00:15:41,331
If you're heading to campus,

206
00:15:41,331 --> 00:15:43,456
Wu can give you a ride.

207
00:15:52,545 --> 00:15:54,337
<i>Join me at the salon from now on.</i>

208
00:15:57,097 --> 00:15:58,538
Big Bro.

209
00:16:00,847 --> 00:16:03,931
Is this little lackey of yours
becoming your personal assistant now?

210
00:16:03,931 --> 00:16:06,222
He's come all the way to school.

211
00:16:06,222 --> 00:16:08,479
He's only here to drop off my meal.

212
00:16:10,972 --> 00:16:13,139
- Big Bro.
- Hey now, Xiao Fan.

213
00:16:13,139 --> 00:16:14,681
Don't rush.

214
00:16:14,681 --> 00:16:18,056
A few more minutes won't make him hungry.

215
00:16:18,056 --> 00:16:20,139
Big Bro, where are you eating?

216
00:16:20,139 --> 00:16:21,306
The dorm or the cafeteria?

217
00:16:21,306 --> 00:16:23,597
After you finish eating,
I'll take the container back.

218
00:16:23,597 --> 00:16:25,810
That'll save you the trouble.

219
00:16:27,306 --> 00:16:29,722
I'll take it back tonight.

220
00:16:29,722 --> 00:16:31,139
Why go to so much trouble?

221
00:16:31,139 --> 00:16:32,764
He brought the soup all the way here.

222
00:16:32,764 --> 00:16:35,556
Come eat with us in the cafeteria.

223
00:16:36,389 --> 00:16:39,431
Big Bro, I'll head back then.

224
00:16:39,431 --> 00:16:40,722
Hold on.

225
00:16:40,722 --> 00:16:42,005
Yeah?

226
00:16:43,931 --> 00:16:46,472
Call Mrs. Lu when you're home.

227
00:16:46,472 --> 00:16:48,722
I've written an recommendation letter
for your brother.

228
00:16:48,722 --> 00:16:51,431
Once he graduates,
he can take his diploma and the letter

229
00:16:51,431 --> 00:16:53,722
to report to the county textile factory.

230
00:16:53,722 --> 00:16:54,931
Thank you.

231
00:16:54,931 --> 00:16:57,192
I'll go call her right now.

232
00:17:02,389 --> 00:17:06,166
His looks are nothing special.

233
00:17:11,014 --> 00:17:12,365
Looks pretty good.

234
00:17:13,051 --> 00:17:14,806
Mr. Bei.

235
00:17:14,806 --> 00:17:16,972
It hasn't even been that long.

236
00:17:16,972 --> 00:17:18,994
I mean the soup.

237
00:17:19,972 --> 00:17:21,472
Xiao Fan.

238
00:17:21,472 --> 00:17:22,889
Xiao Fan.

239
00:17:22,889 --> 00:17:24,472
Lv Xin called to ask you pick her up.

240
00:17:24,472 --> 00:17:26,139
I wrote down the address for you.

241
00:17:26,139 --> 00:17:27,884
Take a taxi.

242
00:17:28,850 --> 00:17:29,890
Oh, Xiao Fan.

243
00:17:29,890 --> 00:17:32,139
I could tell from her voice
she'd had one too many.

244
00:17:32,139 --> 00:17:33,389
Be careful.

245
00:17:33,389 --> 00:17:35,015
All right.

246
00:18:00,514 --> 00:18:02,095
Lv Xin.

247
00:18:09,014 --> 00:18:10,978
Who's this?

248
00:18:14,472 --> 00:18:16,475
Lv Xin.

249
00:18:20,139 --> 00:18:22,222
This guy...

250
00:18:22,222 --> 00:18:25,654
is my husband.

251
00:18:27,514 --> 00:18:32,978
My dear father found me
such a wonderful husband.

252
00:18:36,139 --> 00:18:37,347
Lv Xin.

253
00:18:37,347 --> 00:18:38,681
It's getting late.

254
00:18:38,681 --> 00:18:41,018
Let me take you home.

255
00:18:41,681 --> 00:18:43,944
Go away.

256
00:18:44,764 --> 00:18:47,147
How dare you!

257
00:18:52,306 --> 00:18:55,926
Yeah, some husband you are.

258
00:19:02,556 --> 00:19:04,469
What a joke.

259
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:08,681
Just leave.

260
00:19:08,681 --> 00:19:11,097
Don't push your luck.

261
00:19:11,097 --> 00:19:13,672
Stay away from Bei Lv Qing.

262
00:19:14,764 --> 00:19:17,059
My brother's nice to you...

263
00:19:18,472 --> 00:19:21,409
because he's being polite to you, nothing else.

264
00:19:22,014 --> 00:19:23,431
Don't push your luck.

265
00:19:23,431 --> 00:19:24,556
Don't mess with his life.

266
00:19:24,556 --> 00:19:26,389
Got it?

267
00:19:26,389 --> 00:19:27,972
Don't push your luck.

268
00:19:27,972 --> 00:19:29,431
You got that?

269
00:19:29,431 --> 00:19:30,847
Now get lost.

270
00:19:30,847 --> 00:19:32,514
Yeah, what are you even doing here?

271
00:19:32,514 --> 00:19:35,056
What are you hanging around for?

272
00:19:35,056 --> 00:19:37,469
Just go already.

273
00:20:03,264 --> 00:20:05,251
I'm sorry, Big Bro.

274
00:20:08,056 --> 00:20:10,266
I don't have any money on me.

275
00:20:10,889 --> 00:20:13,181
They needed to pay the bill.

276
00:20:13,181 --> 00:20:15,715
I only remembered your number.

277
00:20:21,847 --> 00:20:23,625
Wipe yourself first.

278
00:20:33,014 --> 00:20:34,827
What happened?

279
00:20:38,139 --> 00:20:39,892
It's all my fault.

280
00:20:41,014 --> 00:20:42,794
I'm sorry.

281
00:20:43,722 --> 00:20:46,473
I made Lv Xin angry.

282
00:20:47,639 --> 00:20:49,443
Where's Bei Lv Xin?

283
00:20:57,556 --> 00:20:58,597
<i>Lv Qing.</i>

284
00:20:58,597 --> 00:20:59,847
<i>I just got a call.</i>

285
00:20:59,847 --> 00:21:01,014
<i>Where are you?</i>

286
00:21:01,014 --> 00:21:03,097
<i>Lv Xin has had a miscarriage.</i>

287
00:21:03,097 --> 00:21:04,639
<i>Don't tell Xiao Fan yet.</i>

288
00:21:04,639 --> 00:21:06,763
<i>Get over here quickly.</i>

289
00:21:07,681 --> 00:21:09,264
Lv Xin had a fall.

290
00:21:09,264 --> 00:21:10,931
She's at the hospital.

291
00:21:10,931 --> 00:21:12,264
You go back first.

292
00:21:12,264 --> 00:21:13,806
I need to head over there.

293
00:21:13,806 --> 00:21:15,941
Is the baby okay?

294
00:21:19,722 --> 00:21:21,938
I'm sorry, Big Bro.

295
00:21:34,139 --> 00:21:36,412
You know, you Lu family folks...

296
00:21:37,889 --> 00:21:39,889
aren't as dumb as I thought.

297
00:21:40,597 --> 00:21:43,514
<i>Being useful was Lu Xiao Fan's only reassurance</i>

298
00:21:43,514 --> 00:21:46,963
<i>to stay in the Bei household.</i>

299
00:21:47,639 --> 00:21:49,639
<i>Now, Lu Xiao Fan realized</i>

300
00:21:49,639 --> 00:21:53,597
<i>he had no grounds or reason
to stay in the Bei family.</i>

301
00:21:53,597 --> 00:21:56,056
<i>But once Lu Xiao Fan made up his mind,</i>

302
00:21:56,056 --> 00:21:58,823
<i>a hint of reluctance welled up inside him.</i>

303
00:21:59,557 --> 00:22:00,807
<i>Reluctant about what?</i>

304
00:22:00,807 --> 00:22:03,431
<i>He couldn't quite figure it out.</i>

305
00:22:03,431 --> 00:22:07,443
<i>But leaving seemed inevitable.</i>

306
00:22:11,431 --> 00:22:12,722
Big Bro.

307
00:22:12,722 --> 00:22:14,502
Are you leaving?

308
00:22:16,183 --> 00:22:17,454
I...

309
00:22:18,222 --> 00:22:20,541
I'm useless now, aren't I?

310
00:22:21,222 --> 00:22:24,190
What use did you ever think you had?

311
00:22:30,806 --> 00:22:32,722
Big Bro...

312
00:22:32,722 --> 00:22:36,540
About my brother's job...

313
00:22:38,264 --> 00:22:42,056
Mom wanted to ask about it today.

314
00:22:42,056 --> 00:22:45,181
She wants to ask
if our promise will still be kept?

315
00:22:45,181 --> 00:22:48,431
Will the Bei family still honor this marriage?

316
00:22:48,431 --> 00:22:50,264
No.

317
00:22:50,264 --> 00:22:53,764
We've already brought
plenty of trouble to Mr. Bei.

318
00:22:53,764 --> 00:22:55,764
As for my mom,

319
00:22:55,764 --> 00:22:57,514
I'll explain things clearly to her.

320
00:22:57,514 --> 00:22:59,684
Your mom won't let you leave.

321
00:23:01,681 --> 00:23:02,989
Yeah.

322
00:23:06,264 --> 00:23:10,980
Your worth is decided by yourself.

323
00:23:11,847 --> 00:23:13,472
Where your value lies

324
00:23:13,472 --> 00:23:15,384
is for you to find on your own.

325
00:23:16,806 --> 00:23:18,661
Dad is waiting for you.

326
00:23:28,931 --> 00:23:32,131
Xiao Fan, come, sit down and let's talk.

327
00:23:38,472 --> 00:23:42,087
Since it's come to this, let's be frank.

328
00:23:43,181 --> 00:23:46,414
You know why the Bei family took you in.

329
00:23:47,222 --> 00:23:51,430
You understand the situation now.

330
00:23:56,181 --> 00:23:59,014
We always keep our promises.

331
00:23:59,014 --> 00:24:01,222
You can stay and finish school.

332
00:24:01,222 --> 00:24:04,139
I'll get you a good job.

333
00:24:04,139 --> 00:24:07,597
Or take some money

334
00:24:07,597 --> 00:24:09,456
and head home.

335
00:24:13,681 --> 00:24:14,931
It's all right.

336
00:24:14,931 --> 00:24:17,886
Just say what's on your mind.

337
00:24:18,893 --> 00:24:21,931
There's no telling what trouble
Lv Xin might cause later on.

338
00:24:21,931 --> 00:24:25,610
Having him just in name has its uses.

339
00:24:36,389 --> 00:24:38,557
I want to stay with the Bei family.

340
00:24:41,514 --> 00:24:43,431
Then everything stays as it is.

341
00:24:43,431 --> 00:24:45,840
Focus on your exams.

342
00:25:06,889 --> 00:25:09,688
Aunt Lin, the bed feels a little hard.

343
00:25:09,688 --> 00:25:11,951
Please add one more cushion.

344
00:25:13,597 --> 00:25:15,160
Lv Xin.

345
00:25:17,431 --> 00:25:19,042
Get out.

346
00:25:26,764 --> 00:25:28,972
Aunt Lin said you haven't been
eating well lately.

347
00:25:28,972 --> 00:25:31,231
I told you to get out.

348
00:25:32,972 --> 00:25:35,038
I made some soup.

349
00:25:37,409 --> 00:25:39,569
Are you deaf or what?

350
00:25:55,931 --> 00:25:57,963
When are you heading back?

351
00:26:00,597 --> 00:26:04,170
Big Bro says I should finish my exams first.

352
00:26:08,472 --> 00:26:11,509
You never cease to amaze me, Lu Xiao Fan.

353
00:26:12,472 --> 00:26:15,222
Why do you keep bothering my brother?

354
00:26:15,222 --> 00:26:18,504
How dare you stay here and have another meal!

355
00:26:22,306 --> 00:26:26,441
Lv Xin, let me take you back to your room.

356
00:26:46,514 --> 00:26:49,216
Lv Xin, be careful, don't catch a chill.

357
00:26:56,222 --> 00:26:58,472
Big Bro and Dad asked me to look after you.

358
00:26:58,472 --> 00:26:59,931
The child is gone now.

359
00:26:59,931 --> 00:27:02,041
I don't need a fake husband.

360
00:27:03,347 --> 00:27:05,021
Mr. Bei said...

361
00:27:05,889 --> 00:27:07,722
we won't divorce for now.

362
00:27:07,722 --> 00:27:09,222
No divorce and keep it quiet.

363
00:27:09,222 --> 00:27:11,471
Do I need you to tell me that?

364
00:27:13,597 --> 00:27:16,139
I'm stuck in this dump,

365
00:27:16,139 --> 00:27:18,764
just pretending I'm traveling overseas.

366
00:27:18,764 --> 00:27:21,264
Mr. Bei means well for you.

367
00:27:21,264 --> 00:27:23,019
Means well?

368
00:27:27,681 --> 00:27:28,681
Do you know why my mother

369
00:27:28,681 --> 00:27:31,441
only took my brother to Gangcheng back then?

370
00:27:32,306 --> 00:27:35,935
- I just wanted...
- I'm not Bei Mo Sha's biological daughter.

371
00:27:44,806 --> 00:27:46,764
To my mother and the Bei family,

372
00:27:46,764 --> 00:27:48,887
I'm nothing but a disgrace.

373
00:27:49,764 --> 00:27:52,444
Just like my lost baby.

374
00:27:54,597 --> 00:27:56,722
They don't care if I live or die.

375
00:27:56,722 --> 00:27:59,241
They don't mean well toward me.

376
00:27:59,241 --> 00:28:01,431
Now do you get it?

377
00:28:01,431 --> 00:28:03,597
Even as my husband,

378
00:28:03,597 --> 00:28:05,722
you stand to gain nothing.

379
00:28:05,722 --> 00:28:07,684
Get lost while you still can.

380
00:28:09,818 --> 00:28:11,264
No, that isn't it.

381
00:28:11,264 --> 00:28:13,681
Can't you have a shred of self-respect?

382
00:28:13,681 --> 00:28:16,754
You just want to profit from this title.

383
00:28:17,472 --> 00:28:19,712
I'm not after anything.

384
00:28:20,556 --> 00:28:23,972
I just want to be useful.

385
00:28:23,972 --> 00:28:26,097
Now I am useful.

386
00:28:26,097 --> 00:28:28,597
Useful to the Bei family.

387
00:28:28,597 --> 00:28:30,597
Useful to you...

388
00:28:30,597 --> 00:28:32,924
And useful to Big Bro, too.

389
00:28:34,389 --> 00:28:37,554
As long as I can be of some use,
I'll be content.

390
00:28:39,222 --> 00:28:41,368
I'm also very grateful to Big Bro.

391
00:28:41,972 --> 00:28:43,389
For quite a while now,

392
00:28:43,389 --> 00:28:45,930
he's helped me a lot.

393
00:29:25,597 --> 00:29:28,639
Get some rest first.

394
00:29:28,639 --> 00:29:31,264
If the seasoning is right,

395
00:29:31,264 --> 00:29:34,097
- I'll also...
- Do whatever you want.

396
00:29:34,097 --> 00:29:37,154
Just don't go thinking
you're part of the Bei family.

397
00:30:13,556 --> 00:30:14,924
Big Bro.

398
00:30:17,264 --> 00:30:18,597
Big Bro.

399
00:30:18,597 --> 00:30:19,972
I'm sorry.

400
00:30:19,972 --> 00:30:22,301
I've caused you trouble again.

401
00:30:33,889 --> 00:30:36,431
How's your exam prep going?

402
00:30:36,431 --> 00:30:37,863
It's all right.

403
00:30:38,722 --> 00:30:40,222
Lv Xin, she...

404
00:30:40,222 --> 00:30:42,056
You have the college entrance
examinations in two months.

405
00:30:42,056 --> 00:30:44,401
Don't bring me soup anymore.

406
00:30:45,306 --> 00:30:47,889
No. It won't be a problem.

407
00:30:47,889 --> 00:30:50,764
I'll study first, then bring you soup.

408
00:30:50,764 --> 00:30:53,016
It won't affect my revision.

409
00:30:56,181 --> 00:30:57,894
Whatever.

410
00:31:20,847 --> 00:31:22,222
This soup is fantastic.

411
00:31:22,222 --> 00:31:24,389
Xiao Fan, you make it even better than I do.

412
00:31:24,389 --> 00:31:26,264
Did your mother teach you?

413
00:31:26,264 --> 00:31:28,097
The books spell everything out clearly.

414
00:31:28,097 --> 00:31:30,097
Whether it's too bland or too salty,

415
00:31:30,097 --> 00:31:32,583
my brother will tell me after he tastes it.

416
00:31:33,431 --> 00:31:36,119
Big Bro, you're back.

417
00:31:41,222 --> 00:31:43,495
Your admission letter has arrived.

418
00:31:49,924 --> 00:31:54,098
[Yunjing People's University]
[Admission Notice]

419
00:31:57,306 --> 00:31:59,395
You really got in.

420
00:32:02,139 --> 00:32:04,914
Just fell a little short of getting into
the undergraduate course.

421
00:32:05,764 --> 00:32:07,139
It's okay.

422
00:32:07,139 --> 00:32:09,965
I'm happy to be in the same school as you.

423
00:32:17,806 --> 00:32:20,485
Big Bro, try some.

424
00:32:35,139 --> 00:32:36,831
Come on!

425
00:32:37,764 --> 00:32:39,639
Come on!

426
00:32:39,639 --> 00:32:41,877
Come on! Big Bro!

427
00:33:25,514 --> 00:33:27,300
Wipe your sweat.

428
00:33:28,597 --> 00:33:30,362
Have some water.

429
00:33:33,806 --> 00:33:35,389
Why's your voice hoarse?

430
00:33:35,389 --> 00:33:36,972
I cheered too hard for you.

431
00:33:36,972 --> 00:33:39,597
Lu Xiao Fan, you're so biased.

432
00:33:39,597 --> 00:33:40,910
Where's mine?

433
00:33:41,972 --> 00:33:43,972
Does Young Master Lin need water?

434
00:33:43,972 --> 00:33:45,181
Fine, fine, fine.

435
00:33:45,181 --> 00:33:46,931
- Who's that?
- He's from the countryside.

436
00:33:46,931 --> 00:33:48,681
And he's hanging around Bei.

437
00:33:48,681 --> 00:33:50,097
He's being way too eager.

438
00:33:50,097 --> 00:33:52,681
He's happy being a lackey.

439
00:33:52,681 --> 00:33:53,681
Don't talk nonsense.

440
00:33:53,681 --> 00:33:55,014
What do you mean, lackey?

441
00:33:55,014 --> 00:33:57,366
That's called logistics support.

442
00:33:58,764 --> 00:34:00,806
Logistics support, huh?

443
00:34:06,222 --> 00:34:08,431
Look, there he goes again.

444
00:34:08,431 --> 00:34:10,514
He's taking food to Bei.

445
00:34:10,514 --> 00:34:11,722
You even need to ask?

446
00:34:11,722 --> 00:34:15,097
Just saw him over there carrying Bei's meals.

447
00:34:15,097 --> 00:34:16,348
How embarrassing.

448
00:34:16,348 --> 00:34:18,764
He's disgraced our whole vocational department.

449
00:34:18,764 --> 00:34:21,425
He likes being a yes-man.

450
00:34:22,139 --> 00:34:24,014
Big Bro, have this.

451
00:34:24,014 --> 00:34:25,056
This fish has fewer bones.

452
00:34:25,056 --> 00:34:26,514
Do you have enough to eat?

453
00:34:26,514 --> 00:34:27,932
Yeah.

454
00:34:30,389 --> 00:34:31,473
Eating this well, huh?

455
00:34:31,473 --> 00:34:33,597
Didn't bother to bring me any?

456
00:34:33,597 --> 00:34:36,464
- I'll bring you some next time.
- It's a deal.

457
00:34:38,097 --> 00:34:39,181
Take a look at that.

458
00:34:39,181 --> 00:34:42,222
Over there, he's eating like a king.

459
00:34:42,222 --> 00:34:43,889
Why even return to our dorm?

460
00:34:43,889 --> 00:34:45,056
Look at him.

461
00:34:45,056 --> 00:34:46,878
Serving tea and water.

462
00:34:46,878 --> 00:34:48,431
Chasing behind those guys.

463
00:34:48,431 --> 00:34:51,306
Serving as Bei's personal servant now.

464
00:34:51,306 --> 00:34:53,998
All to curry favor and join their family.

465
00:34:59,097 --> 00:35:00,472
Just eat.

466
00:35:17,222 --> 00:35:18,764
Has anyone seen my book?

467
00:35:18,764 --> 00:35:20,056
The one with the blue cover.

468
00:35:20,056 --> 00:35:22,347
And a water bottle, too.

469
00:35:22,347 --> 00:35:24,993
Don't you think the cleaner
threw them out as trash?

470
00:35:24,993 --> 00:35:26,681
Huh?

471
00:35:26,681 --> 00:35:28,472
The cleaner was here just now.

472
00:35:28,472 --> 00:35:31,347
Why not check the trash cans in the hallway?

473
00:35:31,347 --> 00:35:33,849
It'd be such a waste to throw them away, right?

474
00:35:33,849 --> 00:35:36,375
Sure, I'll go take a look then.

475
00:35:40,139 --> 00:35:41,746
Ma'am.

476
00:35:53,639 --> 00:35:55,306
Now that's real environmentalism.

477
00:35:55,306 --> 00:35:57,097
Man and books, straight to the bin.

478
00:35:57,097 --> 00:35:58,099
Remember this.

479
00:35:58,099 --> 00:36:01,042
Stop embarrassing our department out there.

480
00:36:27,422 --> 00:36:29,014
Xiao Fan.

481
00:36:29,014 --> 00:36:30,972
We're just talking about Iran right now.

482
00:36:30,972 --> 00:36:33,222
Come listen in.

483
00:36:33,222 --> 00:36:37,597
Zi Yang, I really can't follow
what you're talking about.

484
00:36:37,597 --> 00:36:40,041
I'm just here to bring my brother a book.

485
00:36:44,514 --> 00:36:45,972
About Iran and all that...

486
00:36:45,972 --> 00:36:48,014
You'd better ask my brother.

487
00:36:48,014 --> 00:36:50,264
I'll be going now.

488
00:36:50,264 --> 00:36:53,806
How does a person like Lu Xiao Fan even exist?

489
00:36:53,806 --> 00:36:56,889
Not even the Transformers
change this completely.

490
00:36:56,889 --> 00:36:58,514
Aren't you pathetic?

491
00:36:58,514 --> 00:36:59,931
When he's around, you complain.

492
00:36:59,931 --> 00:37:02,222
When he's gone, you miss him.

493
00:37:02,222 --> 00:37:04,639
See that lawn back there?

494
00:37:04,639 --> 00:37:07,681
- What about it?
- Go cool off over there.

495
00:37:07,681 --> 00:37:09,806
Hey, Bei.

496
00:37:09,806 --> 00:37:13,472
Since when did you
start sticking up for a nobody like that?

497
00:37:13,472 --> 00:37:15,597
Didn't you always loathe people

498
00:37:15,597 --> 00:37:16,764
who curry favor for gains,

499
00:37:16,764 --> 00:37:18,514
just reach out for handouts,

500
00:37:18,514 --> 00:37:21,347
live in humiliation, and die in shame?

501
00:37:21,347 --> 00:37:24,766
Well... I'm still enjoying the novelty.

502
00:37:24,766 --> 00:37:27,014
Fine. Got it.

503
00:37:27,014 --> 00:37:28,764
Whenever you get tired of the novelty,

504
00:37:28,764 --> 00:37:29,806
just give us a heads up

505
00:37:29,806 --> 00:37:31,868
and we can stop gritting our teeth.

506
00:37:31,868 --> 00:37:33,431
Hey, wait.

507
00:37:33,431 --> 00:37:35,597
You really don't know?

508
00:37:35,597 --> 00:37:36,931
What?

509
00:37:36,931 --> 00:37:38,722
A while back,

510
00:37:38,722 --> 00:37:40,847
those punks from the vocational school
beat Lu Xiao Fan up.

511
00:37:40,847 --> 00:37:42,963
It's been a while now.

512
00:38:19,639 --> 00:38:21,806
<i>Dear Teacher,</i>

513
00:38:21,806 --> 00:38:24,722
<i>I'm Lu Xiao Fan,
from the vocational department.</i>

514
00:38:24,722 --> 00:38:26,514
<i>Due to special personal circumstances,</i>

515
00:38:26,514 --> 00:38:30,139
<i>I would like to request some time off.</i>

516
00:38:30,139 --> 00:38:31,389
<i>During my absence,</i>

517
00:38:31,389 --> 00:38:34,764
<i>I will make up for
all missed classes and assignments.</i>

518
00:38:34,764 --> 00:38:37,141
<i>Please grant me this leave.</i>

519
00:38:42,064 --> 00:38:43,897
Where are you going?

520
00:38:44,514 --> 00:38:47,722
I-I'm on leave.

521
00:38:47,722 --> 00:38:49,372
Going home?

522
00:38:50,203 --> 00:38:51,597
No.

523
00:38:51,597 --> 00:38:54,863
- I'm just going out...
- You gonna lay low for a while?

524
00:38:55,566 --> 00:38:56,931
Yeah.

525
00:38:56,931 --> 00:38:59,306
Come on. I'll take you to watch some fun.

526
00:38:59,306 --> 00:39:00,571
Let's go.

